 "text": "Hey, how's your day doing? Lots of planning and communication. Make landing page with a mapping tool, a calendar, and a chat area. Then gear it for summer days, morning and evening, so everyone can see it at a reasonable hour. If some family members are excellent and willing, have them host sessions. Gives each family a hero. Good call. Other hosts can do pasta, sandwiches, whatever people enjoy getting from others. Keep it simple. One night each coming home from work, one morning on weekend if some have families. Asks who can host each session.",
